Ported from harness2/core: tree.py (tree.go), context.py (evidence.go),
recursion.py (recursion.go), selection.py (selection.go), library.py
(library.go), ledger.py (recursion.go), schedule.py (run.go), prompts.py
(prompts.go and prompts/*.md), and the trajectory renderer of
harness2/substrate/opencode.py (trace.go).

Modifications: the editable surface is gocode's own layout (agent/<name>.md
for sub_agents/<name>/AGENT.md, hooks.json declarative tool rules for
plugin/<name>.ts, scripts/*.sh alongside *.py); prompts/surface.md describes
that surface instead of opencode's, and the Jinja-brace rule is dropped since
gocode renders no template; the example workspace fact in prompts/generalize.md
is a coding one; the selector criteria are worded for code changes; the
benchmark adapters, judges and sweep scheduler are not ported. cloud.go,
service.go, workspace.go and overlay.go are new.
